  <span class="clr-heading-xlarge" data-class="clr-heading-xlarge"><span class="c-rio-hp-hero-heading-group"><span class="c-rio-hp-hero-heading-group__item">Collect reviews.</span> <span class="c-rio-hp-hero-heading-group__item">Get found by AI.</span> <span class="c-rio-hp-hero-heading-group__item">Sell more.</span></span></span>
</h1></div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-space-small"></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-text-size-large">Build trust with every shopper and get in front of your future customers in AI search engines like ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, and more.</div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-space-large"></div><div data-exp-reviewsio-email-forward-cta="control" class="apphub-sites--clr-button-row apphub-sites--clr-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-button-wrapper apphub-sites--clr-max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a data-tracking="track-button--bookdemo" data-optibase-click-conversion-id="book_demo_button" href="/lets-chat" class="apphub-sites--clr-button--secondary apphub-sites--clr-button--large w-inline-block"><div class="apphub-sites--c-cta-button-icon-flex"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-button__text">Book demo</div></div></a></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-button-wrapper apphub-sites--clr-max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a data-tracking="track-button--getstarted" data-optibase-click-conversion-id="get_started_button" href="https://www.reviews.io/signup/start?signup_step=email" class="apphub-sites--clr-button--primary apphub-sites--clr-button--large apphub-sites--clr-max-width-full-mobile-landscape w-inline-block"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-button__text--white">Get started</div></a></div></div><div data-exp-reviewsio-email-forward-cta="with-email" class="apphub-sites--c-email-field-cta-section"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-display--none w-embed"><style>
  [data-exp-reviewsio-email-forward-cta~="with-email"] {
    display: none;
  }
</style></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-button-row apphub-sites--c-email-input-section"><div class="apphub-sites--c-hero-email-form-flex apphub-sites--wrap"><div class="apphub-sites--c-hero-email-cta-section w-form"><form id="wf-form-Hero-Section-Collect-Email" name="wf-form-Hero-Section-Collect-Email" data-name="Hero Section Collect Email" method="get" ms-code-form="form" class="apphub-sites--c-hero-email-form-flex" data-wf-page-id="67ac72a9f1c45e07ffd675f5" data-wf-element-id="3212557b-c160-390e-900a-0a0e7c2d2af6"><input class="apphub-sites--clr-form-input apphub-sites--c-email-hero-input w-input" maxlength="256" name="email" data-name="email" placeholder="Enter your email" type="email" id="email" required=""/><input type="submit" data-wait="Free trial" data-optibase-click-conversion-id="get_started_button" data-tracking="track-button--getstarted" class="apphub-sites--clr-button--primary apphub-sites--max-width-full-mobile-landscape w-button" value="Free trial"/></form><div ms-code-success="true" class="apphub-sites--success-message w-form-done"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-text-size-medium">Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-display--none w-embed w-script"><script>
  document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
    window.Webflow?.push(() => {
      const form = document.querySelector("#wf-form-Hero-Section-Collect-Email");
      if (!form) return;

      form.addEventListener("submit", (event) => {
        event.preventDefault();

        const emailEl = form.querySelector('[data-name="email"]');
        const email = (emailEl?.value || emailEl?.textContent || "").trim();

        if (!email) return;

        const url = new URL("/front/pricingplans", window.location.origin);
        url.searchParams.set("useremail", email);

        window.location.href = url.pathname + url.search;
      });
    });
  });
