</style></div><div class="clr-container-large-2"><div class="clr-u-minheight-5rem-2"></div><div data-duration-in="400" data-duration-out="200" data-current="Tab 1" data-easing="ease" class="clr-horizontaltabs w-tabs"><div tabs-menu="clr-horizontaltabs_tabs-menu" id="w-node-b19f4540-2bd7-5ea1-b42f-38be6e49cbaf-6e49cbaa" class="clr-horizontaltabs__tabgroup w-tab-menu"><a data-w-tab="Tab 1" data-class="clr-tabgroup__item" tabs-link="clr-horizontaltabs_tabs-link" class="clr-tabgroup__item w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><h3 class="clr-tabgroup__item__heading">Collect reviews</h3><div class="clr-tabgroup__item__space"></div><div class="clr-tabgroup__item__subheading">Set up flows that ask at the right moment, in the format each customer is most likely to use, from a star rating email to a video upload.</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 2" data-class="clr-tabgroup__item" tabs-link="clr-horizontaltabs_tabs-link" class="clr-tabgroup__item w-inline-block w-tab-link"><h3 class="clr-tabgroup__item__heading">Elevate conversions</h3><div class="clr-tabgroup__item__space"></div><div class="clr-tabgroup__item__subheading">Show the reviews that convert, directly on the pages where shoppers decide.</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 3" data-class="clr-tabgroup__item" tabs-link="clr-horizontaltabs_tabs-link" class="clr-tabgroup__item w-inline-block w-tab-link"><h3 class="clr-tabgroup__item__heading">Optimize experience</h3><div class="clr-tabgroup__item__space"></div><div class="clr-tabgroup__item__subheading">Gain insights, understand your customers better and enhance their shopping experience.</div></a></div><div tab-content="clr-horizontaltabs-content" class="clr-horizontaltabs__content w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Tab 1" tab-pane="clr-horizontaltabs-pane" class="clr-horizontaltabs__content__one w-tab-pane w--tab-active"><div class="w-richtext"><div class="w-embed"><div data-class="animated-gradient animated-gradient--jelly">
