re very happy with REVIEWS.io and the online assistance they provide. Very speedy and easy communication.”</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67addf89c30dba1cda4b8bbe_logo-greyston-test.svg" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-image"/></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-name-badge-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client__name"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card-client__heading">Greyston Bakery</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-badge-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67acc0f0e577c0e8c98ac86c_a38962495caec4ed190181e770663bfe_graphic-badge-checkmark.svg" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-badge"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card--small-viewport apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card--small-viewport-two"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__stars-reviews-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67acc0f0e577c0e8c98ac86a_cd1f98f3a54c19c768d818f37c83453a_graphic-testimonial-stars.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__stars"/><div class="apphub-sites--clr-text-size-small">“We use almost all of the widgets from REVIEWS.io. They&#x27;re great at showcasing our products. ”</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67addf891d7a758a345e6eac_logo-zipster-test.svg" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-image"/></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-name-badge-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client__name"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card-client__heading">Zipster</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-badge-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67acc0f0e577c0e8c98ac86c_a38962495caec4ed190181e770663bfe_graphic-badge-checkmark.svg" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-badge"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card--small-viewport apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card--small-viewport-three"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__stars-reviews-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67acc0f0e577c0e8c98ac86a_cd1f98f3a54c19c768d818f37c83453a_graphic-testimonial-stars.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__stars"/><div class="apphub-sites--clr-text-size-small">&quot;The team from REVIEWS.io is amazing. You can get in touch very easily and they help you super quick with your problem!&quot;</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67addf89dcbe8330e1d36283_logo-krior-test.svg" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-image"/></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-name-badge-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client__name"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card-client__heading">KRIOR</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-badge-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67acc0f0e577c0e8c98ac86c_a38962495caec4ed190181e770663bfe_graphic-badge-checkmark.svg" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-badge"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card--small-viewport apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card--small-viewport-four"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__stars-reviews-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67acc0f0e577c0e8c98ac86a_cd1f98f3a54c19c768d818f37c83453a_graphic-testimonial-stars.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__stars"/><div class="apphub-sites--clr-text-size-small">“Easy to use and helpful team when things get a bit too techy for me to understand!”</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67addf8a1d50d9ba6bf1634c_logo-cooper-test.svg" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-image"/></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-name-badge-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client__name"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card-client__heading">Made By Coopers</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-badge-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67acc0f0e577c0e8c98ac86c_a38962495caec4ed190181e770663bfe_graphic-badge-checkmark.svg" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-badge"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card--small-viewport apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card--small-viewport-five"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__stars-reviews-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67acc0f0e577c0e8c98ac86a_cd1f98f3a54c19c768d818f37c83453a_graphic-testimonial-stars.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__stars"/><div class="apphub-sites--clr-text-size-small">“A complete platform to handle everything review related. Everything is documented on how to implement.”</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67addf8a117f6c428df369cc_logo-ivan-hoe-test.svg" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-image"/></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-name-badge-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client__name"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card-client__heading">Ivanhoe Cycles</div></div><div class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-badge-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/642419dd2be643c50e400f66/67acc0f0e577c0e8c98ac86c_a38962495caec4ed190181e770663bfe_graphic-badge-checkmark.svg" alt="" class="apphub-sites--clr-testimonial-card__client-badge"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-richtext"><div class="w-embed w-script"><script>
  /**
   *  Title: Script for Testimonial Section
   *  Author: Rohan Mistry
   *  Date: 04/01/2025
   *
   *
   */

  const intervalTime = 4000;
  const transitionDuration = 1500;

  /* Logo Animation START */
  let logoAnimationIntervalID;
  const clientLogoContainers = document.querySelectorAll(
    '[js-animation="logo-container"]'
  );

  // Start the animation for the wider viewport
  let previousLogoIndex = null;

  const startLogoOpacityAnimation = () => {
    if (clientLogoContainers.length === 0) return;

    let randomLogoIndex;

    do {
      randomLogoIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * clientLogoContainers.length);
    } while (randomLogoIndex === previousLogoIndex);

    previousLogoIndex = randomLogoIndex;
    logoOpacityAnimation(randomLogoIndex);
  };

  const startLogoOpacityLoop = () => {
    logoAnimationIntervalID = setInterval(startLogoOpacityAnimation, 650);
  };

  // Stop the animation loop for the wider viewport
  const stopLogoOpacityAnimationLoop = () => {
    if (logoAnimationIntervalID) {
      clearInterval(logoAnimationIntervalID);
      logoAnimationIntervalID = null;
    }
  };

  // Reset the logo animation
  const resetLogoOpacityAnimation = () => {
    stopLogoOpacityAnimationLoop();
    clientLogoContainers.forEach((container) => {
      Array.from(container.children).forEach((child, index) => {
        child.style.transition = "";

        if (index === 0) {
          child.style.opacity = "1";
          child.style.transform = "scale(1)";
        } else {
          child.style.opacity = "0";
          child.style.transform = "scale(0.8)";
        }
        child.offsetHeight;
        child.style.transition = `opacity 500ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform 500ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995)`;
      });
    });
  };

  // Perform the animation for logos
  /*
  function logoOpacityAnimation(cardIndex) {
    const logoContainer = clientLogoContainers[cardIndex];
    if (!logoContainer) return;

    // Ensure only one logo has opacity 1 initially
    let visibleLogoIndex = -1;
    Array.from(logoContainer.children).forEach((child, index) => {
      const logoOpacity = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(child).opacity);
      if (logoOpacity === 1) {
        if (visibleLogoIndex === -1) {
          visibleLogoIndex = index; // Keep the first visible logo
        } else {
          child.style.opacity = "0"; // Reset others
          child.style.transform = "scale(0.8)";
        }
      }
    });

    if (visibleLogoIndex === -1) {
      visibleLogoIndex = 0; // Default to the first logo if none are visible
      logoContainer.children[0].style.opacity = "1";
      logoContainer.children[0].style.transform = "scale(1)";
    }

    // Randomly select logos for toggling
    const randomLogoIndex = Math.floor(
      Math.random() * logoContainer.children.length
    );
    const firstLogo = logoContainer.children[randomLogoIndex];
    const secondLogoIndex =
      (randomLogoIndex + 1) % logoContainer.children.length;
    const secondLogo = logoContainer.children[secondLogoIndex];

    if (firstLogo && secondLogo) {
      // Add transition effects
      firstLogo.style.transition = `opacity 500ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform 500ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995)`;
      secondLogo.style.transition = `opacity 500ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform 500ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995)`;

      const firstLogoOpacity = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(firstLogo).opacity);
      const secondLogoOpacity = parseFloat(
        getComputedStyle(secondLogo).opacity
      );

      // Toggle their opacities
      if (firstLogoOpacity === 1 && secondLogoOpacity === 0) {
        toggleLogos(firstLogo, secondLogo, false);
      } else if (firstLogoOpacity === 0 && secondLogoOpacity === 1) {
        toggleLogos(firstLogo, secondLogo, true);
      } else {
        toggleLogos(firstLogo, secondLogo, true);
      }
    }

    function toggleLogos(firstLogo, secondLogo, showFirst) {
      if (showFirst) {
        firstLogo.style.transform = "scale(1)";
        firstLogo.style.opacity = "1";
        secondLogo.style.transform = "scale(0.8)";
        secondLogo.style.opacity = "0";
      } else {
        firstLogo.style.transform = "scale(0.8)";
        firstLogo.style.opacity = "0";
        secondLogo.style.transform = "scale(1)";
        secondLogo.style.opacity = "1";
      }
    }
  } */
  function logoOpacityAnimation(cardIndex) {
    const selectedContainer = clientLogoContainers[cardIndex];
    if (!selectedContainer) return;

    // Get all logos in the selected container
    const logos = Array.from(selectedContainer.children);
    const activeLogoIndex = logos.findIndex(
      (logo) => parseFloat(getComputedStyle(logo).opacity) === 1
    );

    // Select a new random logo to activate
    let newLogoIndex;

    if (logos.length === 1) {
      newLogoIndex = 0;
    } else {
      do {
        newLogoIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * logos.length);
      } while (newLogoIndex === activeLogoIndex);
    }

    const newActiveLogo = logos[newLogoIndex];
    const currentActiveLogo = logos[activeLogoIndex];

    // Apply transitions and update opacities
    if (currentActiveLogo) {
      currentActiveLogo.style.transition = `opacity 500ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform 500ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995)`;
      currentActiveLogo.style.transform = "scale(0.8)";
      currentActiveLogo.style.opacity = "0"; // Deactivate current active logo
    }

    if (newActiveLogo) {
      newActiveLogo.style.transition = `opacity 500ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform 500ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995)`;
      newActiveLogo.style.transform = "scale(1)";
      newActiveLogo.style.opacity = "1"; // Activate new logo
    }
  }

  /* Logo Animation END */

  /* Testimonial Animation START */
  let currentWiderViewportIndex = 0;
  let currentSmallerViewportIndex = 0;
  let widerAnimationIntervalID;
  let smallerAnimationIntervalID;
  let viewportIntersectionFlag = false;

  const testimonialContainerWrapper = document.querySelector(
    '[data-name="testimonial-container"]'
  );

  const testimonialWiderViewportContainers = document.querySelectorAll(
    '[js-animation="animation-testimonial-container"]'
  );

  const testimonialSmallerViewportContainerWrapper = document.querySelector(
    '[js-animation="animation-small-view-testimonial-container"]'
  );

  const testimonialSmallerViewportContainers = Array.from(
    testimonialSmallerViewportContainerWrapper.children
  ).slice(0, -1);

  // Start the animation for the wider viewport
  const startWiderViewportAnimation = () => {
    if (testimonialWiderViewportContainers.length === 0) return;

    widerViewportAnimation(currentWiderViewportIndex);
    currentWiderViewportIndex =
      (currentWiderViewportIndex + 1) %
      testimonialWiderViewportContainers.length;
  };

  // Start the animation for the smaller viewport
  const startSmallerViewportAnimation = () => {
    if (testimonialSmallerViewportContainers.length === 0) return;

    smallViewportTranslateAnimation(currentSmallerViewportIndex);
    currentSmallerViewportIndex =
      (currentSmallerViewportIndex + 1) %
      testimonialSmallerViewportContainers.length;
  };

  // Start the animation loop for the wider viewport
  const startWiderViewportAnimationLoop = () => {
    widerAnimationIntervalID = setInterval(
      startWiderViewportAnimation,
      intervalTime
    );
  };

  // Start the animation loop for the smaller viewport
  const startSmallerViewportAnimationLoop = () => {
    smallerAnimationIntervalID = setInterval(
      startSmallerViewportAnimation,
      intervalTime
    );
  };

  // Stop the animation loop for the wider viewport
  const stopWiderViewportAnimationLoop = () => {
    if (widerAnimationIntervalID) {
      clearInterval(widerAnimationIntervalID);
      widerAnimationIntervalID = null;
    }
  };

  // Stop the animation loop for the smaller viewport
  const stopSmallerViewportAnimationLoop = () => {
    if (smallerAnimationIntervalID) {
      clearInterval(smallerAnimationIntervalID);
      smallerAnimationIntervalID = null;
    }
  };

  // Reset the animation for the wider viewport
  function resetWiderViewportAnimation() {
    testimonialWiderViewportContainers.forEach((cardContainer) => {
      const firstCard = cardContainer.querySelector(
        '[js-animation="animation-first-card"]'
      );
      const secondCard = cardContainer.querySelector(
        '[js-animation="animation-second-card"]'
      );

      if (firstCard && secondCard) {
        firstCard.style.transition = `opacity ${transitionDuration}ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform ${transitionDuration}ms ease`;
        secondCard.style.transition = `opacity ${transitionDuration}ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform ${transitionDuration}ms ease`;
        firstCard.style.opacity = "1";
        firstCard.style.transform = "translateY(0)";
        secondCard.style.opacity = "0";
        secondCard.style.transform = "translateY(0)";
        firstCard.offsetHeight;
      }
    });
    currentWiderViewportIndex = 0;
  }

  // Reset the animation for the smaller viewport
  function resetSmallerViewportAnimationState() {
    testimonialSmallerViewportContainers.forEach((cardContainer) => {
      if (cardContainer) {
        cardContainer.style.transition = `opacity ${transitionDuration}ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform ${transitionDuration}ms ease`;
        cardContainer.style.opacity = "1";
        cardContainer.style.transform = "translateY(0)";
        cardContainer.offsetHeight;
      }
    });

    // Reset the index
    currentSmallerViewportIndex = 0;
  }

  // Perform the animation for a single card in the wider viewport
  function widerViewportAnimation(cardIndex) {
    const cardContainer = testimonialWiderViewportContainers[cardIndex];
    if (!cardContainer) return;

    const firstCard = cardContainer.querySelector(
      '[js-animation="animation-first-card"]'
    );
    const secondCard = cardContainer.querySelector(
      '[js-animation="animation-second-card"]'
    );

    if (firstCard && secondCard) {
      firstCard.style.transition = `opacity ${transitionDuration}ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform ${transitionDuration}ms ease`;
      secondCard.style.transition = `opacity ${transitionDuration}ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform ${transitionDuration}ms ease`;

      firstCard.style.opacity = "0";
      firstCard.style.transform = "translateY(110%)";
      secondCard.style.opacity = "1";
      secondCard.style.transform = "translateY(-110%)";

      // If it's the last card, reset after the animation
      if (cardIndex === testimonialWiderViewportContainers.length - 1) {
        setTimeout(() => {
          resetWiderViewportAnimation();
        }, intervalTime + transitionDuration);
      }
    }
  }

  // Perform the animation for a single card in the smaller viewport
  function smallViewportTranslateAnimation(containerIndex) {
    const cardContainer = testimonialSmallerViewportContainers[containerIndex];
    if (!cardContainer) return;

    cardContainer.style.transition = `opacity ${transitionDuration}ms cubic-bezier(1.000, 0.000, 0.615, 0.995), transform ${transitionDuration}ms ease`;
    cardContainer.style.opacity = "0";
    cardContainer.style.transform = "translateY(110%)";

    if (containerIndex === testimonialSmallerViewportContainers.length - 1) {
      setTimeout(() => {
        resetSmallerViewportAnimationState();
      }, intervalTime + transitionDuration);
    }
  }

  /* Intersection Observer for Both Viewports START */
  const resizeObserver = new ResizeObserver(() => {
    const viewportWidth = window.innerWidth;
    if (viewportWidth < 991) {
      stopWiderViewportAnimationLoop();
      if (viewportWidth < 665) {
        resetLogoOpacityAnimation();
      } else {
        if (!logoAnimationIntervalID) {
          startLogoOpacityLoop();
        }
      }
      if (!smallerAnimationIntervalID) {
        startSmallerViewportAnimationLoop();
      }
    } else {
      stopSmallerViewportAnimationLoop();
      if (!widerAnimationIntervalID) {
        startWiderViewportAnimationLoop();
      }
      if (!logoAnimationIntervalID) {
        startLogoOpacityLoop();
      }
    }
  });

  if (testimonialContainerWrapper) {
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        entries.forEach((entry) => {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            viewportIntersectionFlag = true;
            resizeObserver.observe(document.body);
          } else {
            stopLogoOpacityAnimationLoop();
            stopSmallerViewportAnimationLoop();
            stopWiderViewportAnimationLoop();
            viewportIntersectionFlag = false;
            resizeObserver.unobserve(document.body);
          }
        });
      },
      {
        root: null,
        threshold: 0.1,
      }
    );

    observer.observe(testimonialContainerWrapper);
  } else {
    console.error("Element not found: [data-name='testimonial-container']");
  }
  /* Intersection Observer for Both Viewports END */

  /* Focus/Blur Event Listeners START */
  window.addEventListener("blur", () => {
    stopSmallerViewportAnimationLoop();
    stopWiderViewportAnimationLoop();
    stopLogoOpacityAnimationLoop();
  });

  window.addEventListener("focus", () => {
    if (window.innerWidth > 991 && viewportIntersectionFlag) {
      if (!widerAnimationIntervalID) {
        startWiderViewportAnimationLoop();
      }
    } else if (window.innerWidth < 991 && viewportIntersectionFlag) {
      if (!smallerAnimationIntervalID) {
        startSmallerViewportAnimationLoop();
      }
    }
    if (window.innerWidth > 665) {
      if (!logoAnimationIntervalID) {
        startLogoOpacityLoop();
      }
    }
  });
  /* Focus/Blur Event Listeners END */
  /* Testimonial Animation END */
</script></div></div></section><footer data-class="clr-footer__component" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-page-padding"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-container-large"><div class="apphub-sites--clr-padding-vertical-xlarge"><div class="w-layout-grid apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_top-wrapper"><div class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link-list"><h3 data-class="clr-reviews-footer_link-list-heading" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link-list-heading">platform</h3><a data-class="clr-reviews-footer_link" href="/business-solutions" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link w-inline-block"><div>Overview</div></a><a data-class="clr-reviews-footer_link" href="/front/review-collection" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link w-inline-block"><div>Reviews</div></a><a data-class="clr-reviews-footer_link" href="/front/ugc" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link w-inline-block"><div>UGC</div></a><a data-class="clr-reviews-footer_link" href="/front/loyalty" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link w-inline-block"><div>Loyalty</div></a><a data-class="clr-reviews-footer_link" href="/front/surveys" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link w-inline-block"><div>Surveys</div></a><a data-class="clr-reviews-footer_link" href="/front/pricingplans" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link w-inline-block"><div>Pricing</div></a><a data-class="clr-reviews-footer_link" href="/front/integration-library" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link w-inline-block"><div>Integrations</div></a></div><div class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link-list"><h3 data-class="clr-reviews-footer_link-list-heading" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link-list-heading">Features</h3><a data-class="clr-reviews-footer_link" href="/front/ai-insights" class="apphub-sites--c-reviews-footer_link apphub-sites--wrap w-inline-block"><div class="apphub-sites--c-ai-insights-sparkle-flex"><div>AI Insights</div><div class="apphub-sites--c-icon-embed w-embed"><svg width